      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 47: from about 21:00 to 21:15 I was at home; around 21:16 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 22:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:12 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 08:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:05 I passed through the square; from about 08:00 to 11:45 I was at the grocery.",
