      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 47, from about 21:00 I was at the Grey Heron; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 48 at the grocery from about 08:15; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; at the mill from about 09:15; at the Pryce house from about 10:15; home around 11:15.",
      "time": 67499,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
