      "key": "K0280",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 47: from about 21:00 to 22:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:11 I passed through the square; around 22:17 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:18 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:24 I passed through the square; from about 08:30 to 11:45 I was at the grocery.",
